hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"325","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Mugheera bin Shoaba key paas daakhil huey jabke unhon-ne aik din Iraq mein namaz mein takheer ki thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Ye kya hai ae Mugheera? Kya tumhey nahi maloom ke Jibreel (Alaihissalam) naazil huey aur namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir unhon-ne namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir unhon-ne namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir unhon-ne namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir unhon-ne namaz padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi. Phir farmaya: Mujhey iska hukm diya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 521)"
"326","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Umar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas baithey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum mein se kaun Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key fitney key baarey mein qaul ko yaad rakhta hai? Main ne kaha: Main jaisa Aap ne farmaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum us par bahut jaree ho. Main ne kaha: Aadmi ka fitna uskey ghar walon aur maal aur aulaad aur padosi mein hai, use namaz aur rozah aur sadqa aur neki ka hukm aur buraai se rokna mita deta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ye nahi chahta. Lekin wo fitna jo samandar ki tarah maujein maarta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen! Tum par us se koi harj nahi hai. Beshak tumharey aur uskey darmiyaan band darwaaza hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya wo toda jaaeyga ya khola jaaeyga? Unhon-ne kaha: Toda jaaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir wo kabhi band na kya jaaeyga. Ham ne kaha: Kya Umar darwaazey ko jaantey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, jaisey ke subah se pehley raat hoti hai. Beshak main ne unhey aisi hadees sunaai jo ghalat baaton se nahi hai. To ham Huzaifa se poochhney se darey to ham ne Masrooq ko hukm diya aur us ne un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Darwaaza Umar hain. (Bukhari: 525)"
"327","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Huzaifa Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai: Meri ummat mein se jo us par amal karey (uskey liye). (Bukhari: 4687)"
"328","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Huzaifa Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai: Meri ummat mein se jo us par amal karey (uskey liye). (Bukhari: 4687)"
"329","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Allah ko kaunsa amal zyada mehboob hai? Aap ne farmaya: Namaz apne waqt par. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir kaunsa? Aap ne farmaya: Phir waalidain key sath neki. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir kaunsa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key raastey mein jihaad. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne mujhey ye sunaaein aur agar main zyada maangta to Aap mujhey zyada detey. (Bukhari: 527)"
"330","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Batao agar tum mein se kisi key darwaazey par nehar ho jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl karey, tum kya kehtey ho: Kya wo uski mail mein se kuchh baaqi rakkheygi? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo uski mail mein se kuchh baaqi nahi rakkheygi. Aap ne farmaya: To paanch namazon ki misaal aisi hai, Allah unkey zariye gunaah mita deta hai. (Bukhari: 528)"
"331","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Sajdey mein etedaal karo aur apne baazu kuttey ki tarah na bichhao. Aur jab thookey to apne saamney aur na apne daaen taraf thookey, beshak wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai. (Bukhari: 532)"
"332","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab garmi sakht ho to namaz thandi kar key padho. Beshak sakht garmi Jahannum ki lapak se hai. Aur aag ne apne Rab se shikaayat ki aur kaha: Ae merey Rab! Mera baaz baaz ko kha gaya. To usey do saanson ki ijazat di gai: Sardi mein saans aur garmi mein saans. To wo sakht tareen hai jo tum garmi mein se paatey ho aur sakht tareen hai jo tum sakht sardi mein se paatey ho. (Bukhari: 536-537)"
"333","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr Ghifaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they. To moazzin ne Zohar ki azaan kehna chaaha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Thanda kar lo. Phir us ne azaan kehna chaaha to Aap ne us se farmaya: Thanda kar lo. Yahan tak ke ham ne teelon ka saaya dekha. (Bukhari: 539)"
"334","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jab sooraj dhal gaya tha aur Zohar padhi. To mimbar par khadey huey aur Qiyaamat ka zikr kya aur zikr kya ke us mein badi badi baatein hain. Phir farmaya: Jo kisi cheez key baarey mein poochhna chaahaaey to poochhey. To tum mujh se kisi cheez key baarey mein na poochhogey magar main tumhey bataaunga jab tak main apne is maqaam mein hun. To log roney mein bahut huey aur Aap ne bahut farmaya: Mujh se poochho. To Abdullah bin Huzaafa Sahmi khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Mera baap kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara baap Huzaafa hai. Phir Aap ne bahut farmaya: Mujh se poochho. To Umar apne ghutnon par baithey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham Allah key Rab honay aur Islam key deen honay aur Muhammad key Nabi honay par raazi hain. To Aap khaamosh ho gaey. Phir farmaya: Abhi mujh par Jannat aur aag is deewar key saamney pesh ki gaein. To main ne bhalai aur buraai jaisa (aaj) na dekha. (Bukhari: 540)"
"335","[AI-translation] Abu Barza (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Subah padhtey they jabke ham mein se koi apne paas baithney waley ko pehchaanta tha. Aur us mein saaath se sau tak (aayatein) padhtey they. Aur Zohar padhtey jab sooraj dhal jaata. Aur Asr jabke ham mein se koi Madina key door tareen hissey ki taraf jaata aur wapas aata jabke sooraj zinda hota. Aur main bhool gaya jo unhon-ne Maghrib key baarey mein kaha. Aur Isha ko raat key tihaai tak moakkhar karney ki parwa na kartey. Phir kaha: Aadhi raat tak. (Bukhari: 541)"
"336","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina mein saat aur aath (rakatein mila kar) padhein: Zohar aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha. (Bukhari: 543)"
"337","[AI-translation] Abu Barza (Raziallahu anhu) ki namazon key zikr mein hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya jab Isha ka zikr kya: Wo Isha se pehley soney aur uskey baad baat karney ko naapasand kartey they. (Bukhari: 541)"
"338","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Asr padhtey they, phir insaan Bani Amr bin Auf ki taraf nikalta aur unhey Asr padhtey huey paata. (Bukhari: 548)"
"339","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Anas Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr padhtey they jabke sooraj buland zinda hota. To jaaney wala Awaali ki taraf jaata aur unkey paas aata jabke sooraj buland hota. Aur Awaali ka baaz Madina se chaar meel ya us jaisa door hai. (Bukhari: 550)"
"340","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiski Asr ki namaz faut ho gai goya uskey ghar waley aur uska maal cheen liye gaey. (Bukhari: 552)"
"341","[AI-translation] Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne baadal waley din kaha: Asr ki namaz jaldi padho. Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Asr ki namaz chhor dey to beshak uska amal zaaya ho gaya. (Bukhari: 553)"
"342","[AI-translation] Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they. To Aap ne raat ko chaand ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Beshak tum anqareeb apne Rab ko dekhogey jaisey tum is chaand ko dekhtey ho, usey dekhney mein takleef na paaogey. Phir agar tum taaqat rakkho ke sooraj nikalney se pehley aur uskey ghurub honay se pehley namaz par ghaalib na aao to karo. Phir Aap ne tilaawat ki: (Aur apne Rab ki hamd key sath tasbeeh karo sooraj nikalney se pehley aur ghurub honay se pehley). (Bukhari: 554)"
"343","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein raat key farishtey aur din key farishtey baari baari aatey hain. Aur wo Fajr ki namaz aur Asr ki namaz mein jama hotey hain. Phir jo tum mein raat guzaartey hain upar chadhtey hain. To wo un se poochhta hai jabke wo unhey zyada jaanney wala hai: Tum ne merey bandon ko kaisey chhoda? To wo kehtey hain: Ham ne unhey chhoda jabke wo namaz padh rahey they, aur ham unkey paas aey jabke wo namaz padh rahey they. (Bukhari: 555)"
"344","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Asr ki namaz ka aik sajda sooraj ghurub honay se pehley paa ley to use apni namaz poori karni chaahiye. Aur jab Subah ki namaz ka aik sajda sooraj nikalney se pehley paa ley to use apni namaz poori karni chaahiye. (Bukhari: 556)"
"345","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak tumhara rehna tum se pehli ummaton mein guzar chukon key muqaabley mein aisa hai jaisa Asr ki namaz se sooraj ghurub honay tak. Tauraat walon ko Tauraat di gai to unhon-ne kaam kya yahan tak ke jab din aadha hua to aajiz ho gaey. To unhey aik aik qeeraat diya gaya. Phir Injeel walon ko Injeel di gai to unhon-ne Asr ki namaz tak kaam kya, phir aajiz ho gaey. To unhey aik aik qeeraat diya gaya. Phir hamein Quran diya gaya to ham ne sooraj ghurub honay tak kaam kya. To hamein do do qeeraat diye gaey. To donon Kitaab walon ne kaha: Ae hamaarey Rab! Tune inhey do do qeeraat diye aur hamein aik aik qeeraat diya jabke ham zyada amal waley they? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne farmaya: Kya main ne tumharey ajr mein se kisi cheez mein tum par zulm kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Us ne farmaya: To wo mera fazl hai, use deta hun jisey chaahta hun. (Bukhari: 557)"
"346","[AI-translation] Raafe bin Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Maghrib padhtey they. To ham mein se koi wapas jaata jabke wo apne teeron key girney ki jaghein dekhta tha. (Bukhari: 559)"
"347","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar dopahar mein padhtey they. Aur Asr jabke sooraj saaf hota. Aur Maghrib jab (sooraj) ghurub ho jaata. Aur Isha kabhi kabhi: Jab unhey dekhtey ke wo jama ho gaey hain to jaldi kartey aur jab unhey dekhtey ke wo der kar rahey hain to takheer kartey. Aur Subah ko wo ya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andherey mein padhtey they. (Bukhari: 560)"
"348","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par tumhaari Maghrib ki namaz key naam mein dehaati ghaalib na aa jaaein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur dehaati use Isha kehtey hain. (Bukhari: 563)"
"349","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat Isha mein andhera kar diya. Aur wo Islam phailney se pehley tha. To Aap na nikley yahan tak ke Umar ne kaha: Auratein aur bachchey so gaey. To Aap nikley aur masjid walon se farmaya: Zameen walon mein se tumharey siwa koi uska intezaar nahi kar raha. (Bukhari: 566)"
"350","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur merey saathi jo merey sath kashti mein aey they Baqee-e-Buthaan mein thehrey huey they jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina mein they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Isha ki namaz mein har raat un mein se aik giroh baari baari aata tha. To main aur merey saathi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke Aap apne kisi kaam mein mashghool they. To Aap ne namaz mein andhera kar diya yahan tak ke raat chamak uthi. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley aur unhey namaz padhaai. Phir jab Aap apni namaz poori kar chukey to haazir honay walon se farmaya: Aaraam se raho. Khush ho jao! Beshak tum par Allah ki nemat mein se hai ke logon mein se tumharey siwa koi is ghadi namaz nahi padh raha. Ya farmaya: Tumharey siwa kisi ne is ghadi namaz nahi padhi. Nahi jaantey Aap ne donon kalimat mein se kaunsa farmaya. Abu Musa ne kaha: To ham wapas aey aur jo ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna us se khush huey. (Bukhari: 567)"
"351","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key Isha mein andhera karney ki hadees guzar chuki hai yahan tak ke Umar ne Aap ko pukaara. Aur is mein izaafa hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo namaz padhtey they uskey darmiyaan jo shafaq ghaaeb honay se pehli raat key tihaai tak hai. Aur Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: To Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley goya main Aap ko abhi dekh raha hun, Aap ka sar paani tapak raha hai jabke Aap ne apna haath apne sar par rakkha hua hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar main apni ummat par mushakkat na samajhta to unhey hukm deta ke use aisa padhein. (Bukhari: 569-571)"
"352","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Saabit ne unhey bayan kya ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath sehri ki, phir namaz key liye uthay. Main ne kaha: Un donon key darmiyaan kitna (faasla tha)? Unhon-ne kaha: Pachaas ya saaath ka, yaani aayat (padhney ka waqt). (Bukhari: 575)"
"353","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apne ghar walon mein sehri karta phir mujhey jaldi hoti ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Fajr ki namaz paaun. (Bukhari: 577)"
"354","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Thandey donon (Fajr aur Asr) padhey wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. (Bukhari: 574)"
"355","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhey bayan kya ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath sehri ki, phir namaz key liye uthay. Main ne kaha: Un donon key darmiyaan kitna (faasla tha)? Unhon-ne kaha: Pachaas ya saaath ka, yaani aayat (padhney ka waqt). (Bukhari: 575)"
"356","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apne ghar walon mein sehri karta phir mujhey jaldi hoti ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Fajr ki namaz paaun. (Bukhari: 577). Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz ki aik rakat paa ley to beshak us ne namaz paa li. (580). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"357","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas pasandeeda aadmi gawaah huey, aur merey paas sab se zyada pasandeeda Umar hain, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Subah key baad namaz se mana kya yahan tak ke sooraj nikal aaey, aur Asr key baad yahan tak ke (sooraj) ghurub ho jaey. (Bukhari: 581)"
"358","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni namaz key sath sooraj nikalney aur uskey ghurub honay ka qasd na karo. (Bukhari: 582)"
"359","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab sooraj ka kinaara nikley to namaz moakkhar karo yahan tak ke wo buland ho jaey. Aur jab sooraj ka kinaara ghaaeb ho jaey to namaz moakkhar karo yahan tak ke wo ghurub ho jaey. (Bukhari: 583)"
"360","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do beon aur do libaason aur do namazon se mana kya. Aap ne Subah key baad namaz se mana kya yahan tak ke sooraj nikley aur Asr key baad yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho jaey. (Bukhari: 584)"
"361","[AI-translation] Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum namaz padhtey ho. Beshak ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyaar ki aur ham ne Aap ko use padhtey huey nahi dekha. Aur beshak Aap ne un donon se mana kya tha. Yaani Asr key baad ki do rakatein. (Bukhari: 587)"
"362","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jo use ley gaya! Aap ne unhey na chhoda yahan tak ke Allah se jaa milay. Aur Aap Allah se na milay yahan tak ke Aap par namaz bhaari ho gai. Aur Aap apni bahut namaz baith kar padhtey they. Yaani Asr key baad ki do rakatein. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey padhtey they aur unhey masjid mein na padhtey they, is khauf se ke apni ummat par bhaari karein. Aur Aap pasand kartey they jo unhey halka karey. (Bukhari: 590)"
"363","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Do rakatein aisi hain jinhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chhorey na rakhtey they, chhup kar aur na khul kar. Subah ki namaz se pehley do rakatein aur Asr key baad do rakatein. (Bukhari: 592)"
"364","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat ko chaley. To qaum mein se baaz ne kaha: Kaash Aap hamarey sath thahrein Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey khauf hai ke tum namaz se so jaaogey. Bilaal ne kaha: Main tumhey jagaaunga. To wo letey aur Bilaal ne apni peeth apni sawaari se lagaa di. To unki aankhein un par ghaalib aa gaein aur wo so gaey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaagey jabke sooraj ka kinaara nikal chuka tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Bilaal! Jo tum ne kaha tha wo kahaan hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Mujh par aisi neend kabhi nahi aai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumhaari roohein qabz kein jab chaaha aur unhey tum par wapas kein jab chaaha. Ae Bilaal! Utho aur logon ko namaz ki azaan do. To Aap ne wuzu kya. Phir jab sooraj buland hua aur safed ho gaya to Aap uthay aur namaz padhi. (Bukhari: 595)"
"365","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab Khandaq key din aey jab sooraj ghurub ho chuka tha. To wo kuffaar-e-Quraish ko bura kehney lagey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main Asr shayed hi padh saka yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub honay key qareeb tha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main ne use nahi padha. To ham Buthaan ki taraf uthay. To Aap ne namaz key liye wuzu kya aur ham ne uskey liye wuzu kya. To Aap ne sooraj ghurub honay key baad Asr padhi, phir uskey baad Maghrib padhi. (Bukhari: 596)"
"366","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo namaz bhool jaey to use chaahiye ke jab yaad aaey padhey. Uska kaffaara uskey siwa nahi hai: (Aur meri yaad key liye namaz qaem karo). (Bukhari: 597)"
"367","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum namaz mein rahogey jab tak tum namaz ka intezaar kartey raho. (Bukhari: 600)"
"368","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aaj zameen ki peeth par hai us mein se koi baaqi na rahega. Us se muraad ye ke wo us qarn ko kaat-ta hai. (Bukhari: 601)"
"369","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Suffa waley faqueer log they. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiskey paas do ka khaana ho use teesrey ko ley kar jaana chaahiye. Aur agar chaar ka ho to paanchwein ya chhathey ko. Aur Abu Bakr teen ko laaey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) das ko ley kar chaley. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo main aur merey waalid aur meri waalida they. Aur mujhey nahi maloom unhon-ne kaha: Aur meri biwi, aur aik khaadim hamaarey aur Abu Bakr key ghar key darmiyaan. Aur Abu Bakr ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas raat ka khaana khaaya. Phir thehrey jahaan Isha padhi gai, phir wapas aey. To thehrey yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raat ka khaana khaaya. To wo aey jab raat mein se jitna Allah ne chaaha guzar chuka tha. Unki biwi ne un se kaha: Tumhey tumharey mehmaanon se kis ne rok diya? Ya unhon-ne kaha: Tumharey mehmaan se. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum ne unhey raat ka khaana nahi khilaaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne inkaar kya yahan tak ke tum aao. Beshak unhey pesh kya gaya to unhon-ne inkaar kar diya. Unhon-ne kaha: To main gaya aur chhup gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae naaqis aqal! Aur sakht kaha aur bura kaha. Aur kaha: Khaao, khushgawaar na ho! To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main use kabhi na khaaunga. Aur Allah ki qasam! Ham luqma na letey they magar uskey neechey se us se zyada badhta tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Yaani yahan tak ke wo ser ho gaey. Aur wo us se zyada ho gaya jo us se pehley tha. To Abu Bakr ne usey dekha to wo jaisa tha ya us se zyada tha. To unhon-ne apni biwi se kaha: Ae Bani Firaas ki behan! Ye kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi, meri aankh ki thandak ki qasam! Beshak wo ab us se teen guna zyada hai jo us se pehley tha. To Abu Bakr ne us mein se khaaya aur kaha: Beshak wo shaitaan ki taraf se tha, yaani apni qasam. Phir us mein se luqma khaaya, phir use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley gaey aur wo subah Aap key paas tha. Aur hamaarey aur qaum key darmiyaan muahida tha. To muddat guzar gai. To ham ne baarah aadmi juda kiye, un mein se har aadmi key sath log they. Allah zyada jaanta hai ke har aadmi key sath kitney they. To un sab ne us mein se khaaya. (Bukhari: 602). Kitaab-ul-Azaan."
